    "body": "## Change\n\nUpdate the locked AnyIO version from 4.9.0 to 4.15.1 to address CVE-2026-63374 (patched in 4.14.2). Add a minimum-version override so future lockfile regenerations retain a patched version. This override is necessary because NeMo Run's transitive LeptonAI 0.27.3 dependency still declares `anyio<=4.9.0`.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `uv lock --check` passed in the Megatron-LM dev CI container.\n- Imported AnyIO 4.15.1, LeptonAI 0.27.3, NeMo Run, and HTTPX in that container; an asynchronous HTTPX request through `MockTransport` passed.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n\nThe LeptonAI metadata override needs CI compatibility validation; the focused smoke check does not cover every LeptonAI path. No GPU test was run locally because the host NVIDIA runtime has a driver/library mismatch.\n\nReference: https://github.com/advisories/ghsa-82r6-8w77-94w6\n",
    "changed_files": 2,
